  "benefits": "<br>\n\n**Name of the Component****Standard of Assistance (For Small, Marginal, Women, SC/ST Farmers)****Standard of Assistance (For General/Other Farmers)**Medium-sized goods vehicles (capacity of 600kg to 1500 kg)35% of the total vehicle cost or ₹75,000/-, whichever is lower25% of the total vehicle cost or ₹50,000/-, whichever is lower> **Note:** \n\n\n- **Minimum Time Limit for Reclaiming  Benefits:** 5 Years\n<br>\n\n",
